                                <div class="text-center mb-4">
                                    <h4 class="font-weight-bold text-primary">Welcome to the EEE Alumni Community website at PUST!</h4>
                                </div>
                                <p>Our website serves as a dedicated platform for the graduates of the Electrical and Electronic Engineering (EEE) program at PUST. We are thrilled to provide a virtual space where alumni can connect, collaborate, and stay updated with the latest happenings within our vibrant community.</p>
                                
                                <p>As an EEE alumnus of PUST, this website offers you a range of exciting features and benefits. Here's what you can expect:</p>
                                
                                <div class="card bg-light border-0 p-3 mb-3">
                                    <ul class="list-unstyled mb-0">
                                        <li class="mb-3">
                                            <strong><i class="fas fa-network-wired text-primary mr-2"></i> Networking Opportunities:</strong> Connect with fellow EEE graduates from different batches and explore a vast network of professionals in various industries. Expand your professional circle and foster meaningful connections that can contribute to your personal and career growth.
                                        </li>
                                        <li class="mb-3">
                                            <strong><i class="fas fa-address-book text-success mr-2"></i> Alumni Directory:</strong> Access our comprehensive alumni directory to search and connect with individuals based on their expertise, graduation year, or current occupation. Stay connected with your former classmates, professors, and industry leaders who are part of our esteemed EEE alumni network.
                                        </li>
                                        <li class="mb-3">
                                            <strong><i class="fas fa-calendar-alt text-info mr-2"></i> Events and Reunions:</strong> Stay updated on upcoming events, reunions, and workshops organized exclusively for EEE alumni. Attend insightful webinars, seminars, and social gatherings designed to enhance your knowledge, skills, and overall alumni experience.
                                        </li>
                                        <li class="mb-3">
                                            <strong><i class="fas fa-briefcase text-warning mr-2"></i> Career Support:</strong> Avail yourself of valuable career resources, job opportunities, and mentorship programs tailored specifically for EEE alumni. Leverage the collective expertise of our community to explore new career paths, seek guidance, and unlock professional opportunities.
                                        </li>
                                        <li class="mb-3">
                                            <strong><i class="fas fa-trophy text-danger mr-2"></i> News and Achievements:</strong> Stay informed about the latest news, achievements, and milestones of our alumni community. Celebrate the successes and noteworthy contributions of our graduates while staying connected with the ever-evolving EEE landscape.
                                        </li>
                                        <li class="mb-0">
                                            <strong><i class="fas fa-hands-helping text-secondary mr-2"></i> Engagement and Collaboration:</strong> Engage in discussions, share insights, and collaborate on industry-specific projects with fellow alumni through our interactive forums and interest groups. Leverage the collective knowledge and experiences of our community to foster innovation and drive positive change.
                                        </li>
                                    </ul>
                                </div>

                                <p>We are excited to have you join our EEE Alumni Community website at PUST. Register now to unlock the full potential of this platform and embark on a fulfilling journey of lifelong connections, professional growth, and shared achievements.</p>
                                <p class="font-weight-bold text-center text-dark mt-4">Together, let's strengthen the bond among EEE alumni at PUST and forge a vibrant community that continues to make a positive impact in the field of Electrical and Electronic Engineering.</p>

